#: b4f3c082611a450db9557b85c4866e8d beb4f146fe684798a990029a3bbac5c7
msgid ""
"MAVFTP does not work. Parameter downloads to GCS are delayed starting while "
"the GCS tries to establish a MAVFTP link which cannot be setup, and then "
"proceed slowly to download parameters using the normal download method."
msgstr "MAVFTP 无法工作。地面站的参数下载因 GCS 尝试建立无法建立的 MAVFTP 链接而延迟，然后缓慢地通过普通下载方式下载参数。"

