#: c69997803fd14e2d8790b3b21bb898be d6af29970d7b4102a9f31160def00e47
msgid ""
"Interfaces will not initialize, such as CAN: \"Failed to initialise CAN "
"Interface xx\""
msgstr "接口无法初始化，例如 CAN：「Failed to initialise CAN Interface xx」"

#: ../../source/docs/common-limited-firmware.rst:31
#: 0882288f40e54528ac73e83378655e19 1315d446907d4a79b5726bac8e63b988
#: 4870f173cba84d659e61fc382f6fe7ff 67ed3d88980c43f6a81f0ea25fe0e59c
#: 810089da7f0c407088639d21b79b3097 903856e1ed6841f78f35a24e59928037
#: 9ab06b57ebb94d8899b955db30b7e6c7 b78098de2b74432a96824b7582cc4612
#: ce00714676424bab855c92988c7dbe80 f2fe1e3f56dd4727a46bb02197112239
msgid ""
"If this occurs, several possible options are available to allow temporary "
"use of MAVFTP, download terrain tiles, allow a driver to be loaded, and/or "
"Compass Calibration. All require a reboot to take effect:"
msgstr "如果发生此情况，有几种可能的方案可以临时使用 MAVFTP、下载地形瓦片、加载驱动和/或进行罗盘校准。所有方案均需重启生效："

#: ../../source/docs/common-limited-firmware.rst:33
#: 0499e142743e4c0994ed9c9f2ae517d7 11681a54dd164554b668ed337043f01e
#: 19f1305480fb44b989a1a9d2da28542c 24bdb689b67f4555aca8d57468dcc014
#: 3777130b80e344989ecfd3843a866b61 8e70e65455a048339a5c857cf8546156
#: b03ecfe7122b48afa917f0bcaccbcb02 e4dd4939193f4397b5bae98a0aa74983
#: f368931560804ca9b8334976d8c4b8bd fe6230594556449898ab899493e3e9bf
msgid ""
"Make sure IMU Batch Sampling (used for FFT analysis) is not running by "
"setting :ref:`INS_LOG_BAT_MASK<INS_LOG_BAT_MASK>` = 0."
msgstr ""
"确保 IMU 批量采样（用于 FFT 分析）未运行，方法是将 :ref:`INS_LOG_BAT_MASK<INS_LOG_BAT_MASK>` 设为 "
"0。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-limited-firmware.rst:34
#: 1effb8c672b843bf910d73334566a196 22032dba473f42969e9412f5e8e2f84d
#: 35a650c2b8c744049a2cd0cea538efae 7122c9b442e249d6b1be0d987256f805
#: 816b75b7ffa34078a3471a7ed08aa5e4 9f2cda5b25b14c92bdbf46fa51039b0a
#: d1cb572e7a2343bc8bee569e3549d25f d457bdc7c921452ba250f6ebd2b9bdb9
#: dd61e891c3e64ca581c12c7670ea42ef f8f185ab1bd843f6aee09fdcaf96dadd
msgid ""
"Try temporarily disabling logging by setting "
":ref:`LOG_BACKEND_TYPE<LOG_BACKEND_TYPE>` to 0, then returning to 1 "
"(default) after calibrating."
msgstr ""
"尝试将 :ref:`LOG_BACKEND_TYPE<LOG_BACKEND_TYPE>` 设为 0 以临时禁用日志记录，校准后再恢复为 1（默认值）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-limited-firmware.rst:35
#: 044e4340170c4feba218c8c7f372936b 41c3d96ad7f745ebb3a89fb3b39dfb78
#: 43dceb4476ac440b84e7bcc8895cf7c5 4afcc3e5dbfa4470988d6b98bc92659d
#: 500aa4d234b440098f9e2bb6ea5c8f97 8290be8a0ee34447ab6123066ec7a111
#: abc43a76078a43b49ff39e2c87ed2f1a c4da9a053fac488eb201a95d1108eccc
#: cff8b34db2234ce1b77054c1001e2686 e4466f64135a44eabc852303c4e3bb47
msgid ""
"Reduce the size of :ref:`LOG_FILE_BUFSIZE<LOG_FILE_BUFSIZE>`. However, "
"lowering below 16KB can introduce small gaps in the log. This may be used "
"temporarily to download terrain or calibrate compass."
msgstr ""
"减小 :ref:`LOG_FILE_BUFSIZE<LOG_FILE_BUFSIZE>` 的值。但低于 16KB "
"可能会在日志中引入小间隙。可临时用于下载地形或校准罗盘。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-limited-firmware.rst:36
#: 1e54af9a2d334f2d9dea415780c582df 2836d58a6fc14307ae063e9ee4f9897c
#: 2e936c45a5594f03810dde6883b74ee8 61f7d29f98364d669f6007df929f77e7
#: 6933092975274e32a8d1da104b1323a0 70c6e9bcb1b54ab49a957c4627f0de59
#: 852f65e75f4847e2a819c575d5d52aa1 a9468f733b4a432990941f55b5d2190b
#: f534d53912534867bbfd6f5b294c5b12 fb7ce56bc42746158d33101365a92163
msgid ""
"Disable Terrain Following temporarily by setting "
":ref:`TERRAIN_ENABLE<TERRAIN_ENABLE>` to 0."
msgstr "将 :ref:`TERRAIN_ENABLE<TERRAIN_ENABLE>` 设为 0，临时禁用地形跟随。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-limited-firmware.rst:37
#: 26873a4ffc574a90a6ff0a458ef4964e 4c1160717bcd42f0a3b724a7becb6384
#: 4f3bef56203f49d6a0af5cd9d62d3b1f 81b47713771c430a825306c1ee42e3b4
#: 9ce9253b6d6b40bf9b67a61741332a59 a9561d7f00294b98a2b0c2f02960a83c
#: aa64569b47524808a12397548576dfe3 ab85445753e34ac1bfff32bee7cd7af4
#: dfca148ce9d1437e8617e3f5a9c024ad ef4890551700444b9f99524248de63b4
msgid ""
"Disable SmartRTL on Copter by setting :ref:`SRTL_POINTS<SRTL_POINTS>` = 0."
msgstr "在 Copter 上，将 :ref:`SRTL_POINTS<SRTL_POINTS>` = 0 以禁用 Smart RTL。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-limited-firmware.rst:38
#: 103ddadb5b974cc7a42c2fb952e58a75 443decefa2f04b38a44d8629c555283d
#: 54b02b97b1eb4ce2ae4d4b04e0266068 6129da7203f3416490087b1409ca878a
#: 6967cb3aa7f3445ea926a72bd0847bde 6a20e6dda6264e5bb888eb89437660c0
#: 72a049f03e804568991f44cc3fff1135 bd22846bf25245b3b397089410875fef
#: c4c049aec0ae41dbbd78c9d487cfcbe7 ce5375bb996c4c41a5191c2ec732fb78
msgid ""
"If using DroneCAN, try reducing the memory allocation from the default of "
"16KB (for two nodes) using the ``CAN_Dx_UC_POOL`` parameters."
msgstr "如果使用 DroneCAN，尝试使用 ``CAN_Dx_UC_POOL`` 参数将内存分配从默认的 16KB（两个节点）减少。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-limited-firmware.rst:40
#: 0b1f914ef929482bb2376e0e3b0a408a 19eba11743304d33888908566def3514
#: 1d155c9714694d3dba4b9c781384e5d7 22456794b3e54234b94a3d3a6e35f957
#: 3c6042f207e044f482b50f4097f4c9fe 48e829ae98cb47f2921748a73930c67d
#: 7eae5af1d8d24e99b25d245a8c4d4fbf ab8c85e1eab74beabe51421bc863b577
#: be6b1d7d5d00403cbbb35fa1ca85028d ec1371716d1947c5b27d04a4ecdc9c69
msgid ""
"in Mission Planner's STATUS tab, you can monitor the \"freemem\" status for "
"current free RAM. Be aware, that it's a total of unallocated memory and that"
" everything that requires a memory allocation needs it to be one, contiguous"
" block. But the status will give an indication of what is available. For "
"example, MAVftp needs ~ 12K contiguous block to start."
msgstr ""
"在 Mission Planner 的 STATUS 标签页中，可以监控 「freemem」 状态以查看当前可用 "
"RAM。请注意，这是未分配内存的总量，而且任何需要内存分配的操作都需要一块连续内存。但该状态可以指示可用内存量。例如，MAVftp 需要约 12KB "
"的连续内存块才能启动。"
